<title>USA: Norfolk, Va., to sell $48 mln GOs on April 24.</title>
<headline>Norfolk, Va., to sell $48 mln GOs on April 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk, Va., plans to sell $8.2 million general obligation bonds in a competitive sale set for April 24.</p>
<p>The financial adviser is Public Financial Management Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
